	(text "Same pinout as J1 on the power module: every power pin on the even row (+3.3V_MCU 32/34/36, +1.8V_MCU 26/28/30, DYN_V_EXT 2-16),\nthe odd row is GND except +VMUX and DYN_V_EXT_EN. DYN_V_EXT uses the row next to J3 and its vias (DC sim: <= 1.57 A per pin at 12 A)"
